.409,0.622,0.619,0.491,0.479,0.499,0.43,0.522,0.721,0.654,0.63,0.522,0.577,0.643,0.618,0.239,0.498,0.334,0.227,0.19,0.254,0.183,0.233,0.278,0.243,0.132,0.047,0.012],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: She reaches into the box again and removes a two-faced figurine. It seems to be walnut wood, holding subtle detail in each of its dual masks. Moerway-make. Duality is one of the big themes in their world. Brighid feels–","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.384,"end":18.528,"frac":0.881,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":42},"large":{"start":0.384,"end":18.528,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"DERRY THE MACHINE-PUPPET: [ cackling ] WATCH YOUR STEP!! AHAHAHAHHAHAHAHA","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":9},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"FARRON : This place is one step away from circus curios.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":22.208,"end":24.96,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"large":{"start":22.208,"end":24.96,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"BRIGHID: What was that?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":25.728,"end":26.432,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":3,"words":4},"large":{"start":25.728,"end":26.432,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":3,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"NARRATOR: Ah, a customer. She sets the figure aside, slips on her tinted glasses for the comfort of the client, and prepares to read their wares. She doesn’t mind this part of the job. Customers often tell more about themselves via their objects than their words.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.072,"end":44.544,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":44,"words":46},"large":{"start":27.072,"end":44.544,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":44,"words":46},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"NARRATOR: As she haggles for the shop’s sake she finds new stories for herself. She takes after her Fae mother in that way. While mother scries the present, Brighid reads the past in objects. Her fingers caress the worn porcelain this customer has brought.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":45.44,"end":61.504,"frac":0.977,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":44},"large":{"start":45.44,"end":61.504,"frac":0.977,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":44},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"BRIGHID: Many moons have graced these on cluttered altars. A long line of seers…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":62.272,"end":69.536,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":14},"large":{"start":62.272,"end":69.536,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"FARRON: Okay, that’s enough. You going to buy them off me, or what?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":70.112,"end":72.92,"frac":0.769,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":13},"large":{"start":70.112,"end":72.864,"frac":0.769,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":13},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"NARRATOR: The porcelain memories release her reluctantly, though she catches a glimpse of where this line of seers ends. Farron. Orothea. Curious he’d part with the cups when such strong sentimental attachment radiates from them. Unfortunately, Brighid knows their objective value. It’s not surprising Farron’s unsatisfied when she tells him.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":73.696,"end":96.32,"frac":0.92,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":50},"large":{"start":73.696,"end":96.32,"frac":0.96,"status":"ok","matched":48,"words":50},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"NARRATOR: She excuses herself as gracefully as she can. With sentimentality that heavy, clients generally need the space to accept their change in fortunes.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":97.088,"end":106.752,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"large":{"start":97.088,"end":106.752,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"DERRY: Thief! THIEF!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":3},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":3},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"BRIGHID: Derry, what happened!?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"DERRY: Hands stained with tea, fear in his heart…two-faced customer, two-faced prize!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":109.856,"end":120.46,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":15},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":15},"differ":true},{"i":13,"text":"BRIGHID: He stole the figure. Fuck…and they call us swindlers. I might catch him if I hurry. But how to track him if I don’t?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":121.184,"end":129.408,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":26},"large":{"start":121.184,"end":129.408,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":26},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[{"start":106.64,"end":111.34,"words":8,"text":"dave dave dairy what happened i have both"}],"large":[{"start":116.8,"end":120.2,"words":6,"text":"two faced customer two faced prize"}]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d972c3a6f_5-1b.jpg"}